<div class="install-step-heading"><span class="install-step-heading__number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><p class="install-step-heading__label">Passo 01 / Download</p><h3>Obtenha os arquivos</h3></div></div>

Abra um terminal e execute:

{% set command_id = "install-clone-pt" %}{% set command_label = "1 / Download" %}{% set command_text = "git clone https://github.com/MoisesHsilva1/Pegasus.git ~/.local/share/pegasus\ncd ~/.local/share/pegasus" %}{% include "components/command-block.njk" %}

<div class="install-step-heading"><span class="install-step-heading__number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><p class="install-step-heading__label">Passo 02 / Instalação</p><h3>Inicie a configuração</h3></div></div>

Execute como seu usuário comum. Não use `sudo` com `install.sh`.

{% set command_id = "install-run-pt" %}{% set command_label = "2 / Instalação" %}{% set command_text = "bash install.sh" %}{% include "components/command-block.njk" %}

Revise o plano mostrado pelo Pegasus e confirme quando estiver pronto.

<div class="install-step-heading"><span class="install-step-heading__number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><p class="install-step-heading__label">Passo 03 / Recuperação</p><h3>Se o `gum` estiver ausente</h3></div></div>

Instale-o e execute o Pegasus novamente:

{% set command_id = "install-gum-pt" %}{% set command_label = "Se necessário" %}{% set command_text = "sudo dnf install -y gum\nbash install.sh" %}{% include "components/command-block.njk" %}

## Opções úteis

Use as opções padrão sem perguntas:

{% set command_id = "install-yes-pt" %}{% set command_label = "Sem perguntas" %}{% set command_text = "bash install.sh --yes" %}{% include "components/command-block.njk" %}

Revise ou retome uma instalação:

{% set command_id = "install-options-pt" %}{% set command_label = "Revisar / Retomar" %}{% set command_text = "pegasus install --review\npegasus install --resume" %}{% include "components/command-block.njk" %}

## Depois da instalação

Abra o Pegasus Control Center:

{% set command_id = "control-center-pt" %}{% set command_label = "Central de controle" %}{% set command_text = "pegasus" %}{% include "components/command-block.njk" %}

Você também encontra o **Pegasus Control Center** nos Aplicativos do GNOME.

### Temas

{% set command_id = "theme-commands-pt" %}{% set command_label = "Temas" %}{% set command_text = "pegasus theme\npegasus theme list\npegasus theme apply Nord" %}{% include "components/command-block.njk" %}

### Verifique sua configuração

{% set command_id = "doctor-pt" %}{% set command_label = "Diagnóstico" %}{% set command_text = "pegasus doctor" %}{% include "components/command-block.njk" %}

### Atualizar ou desinstalar

{% set command_id = "maintenance-pt" %}{% set command_label = "Manutenção" %}{% set command_text = "pegasus update\npegasus uninstall" %}{% include "components/command-block.njk" %}
